Careful if endSession resolves outer session while story continues? finalBattle returns 'title' after ending, so done. endSession just resolves promise; boot loop proceeds to title while runStory still in finally. That's okay but mode set to title? `endSession` sets mode='title' and sessionEnded true; then finally unblocks. Outer boot will show title. But runStory may call save after? We skip if title.

